// [DRAFT] D718, D726 — the priest of the god of contracts (black and gold, replaces the witch): the Dark Knight's path
say|OATH_WITCH|Looking for power? ${contract_god} gives it fast. And always writes down the price.
say|OATH_WITCH|Whoever serves him is a Dark Knight: his blade drinks the enemy's blood and heals him with it.
say|OATH_WITCH|The path is chosen at the gate, with the scribe. I only read contracts. I have many of them.
exit|
